#: src/components/ZoneAnalysisCard.tsx:140
msgid "Distribution match uses Bray-Curtis similarity to compare observed and target time-in-zone shares. It appears only when every recent activity has at least 90% duration coverage from valid splits or timestamped samples; sample streams also require a median cadence of 5 seconds or less. These evidence gates are Praxys operational estimates."
msgstr "分布匹配度使用 Bray-Curtis 相似度比较实际与目标的各训练区间时长占比。仅当近期每次活动的有效分段或时间戳采样均覆盖至少 90% 的活动时长时才会显示；采样流还要求中位采样间隔不超过 5 秒。这些证据门槛是 Praxys 的运行性估算。"

